# Every route the server mounts: method, path, guard, asks. Sorted by path, then method.
# read: the gate's viewers. write: a mapped actor and the CSRF triple. act: the same
# check, the actor handed to the work. tap: a `Tap`.
# asks, under a deployment that signs: signed, a device key the history trusts for the
# actor signed the request; possession, the key the request asks for signed it; -, nothing.
GET /api/about read -
POST /api/act/device act signed
POST /api/act/key act possession
POST /api/act/pair act possession
GET /api/act/{*verb} read -
POST /api/author act signed
GET /api/briefings read -
GET /api/briefings/{date} read -
GET /api/calendar/{date} read -
GET /api/chain read -
POST /api/client-errors write -
GET /api/content read -
GET /api/fold read -
POST /api/held/reveal tap signed
GET /api/mail/inbox read -
GET /api/mail/message/{id} read -
GET /api/mail/search read -
GET /api/mail/thread/{id} read -
GET /api/mail/watches read -
POST /api/mail/watches/{id}/cancel tap signed
GET /api/me read -
GET /api/oauth/google/callback read -
GET /api/oauth/google/consent/{card} read -
GET /api/objects read -
POST /api/objects act -
GET /api/overview read -
GET /api/portal read -
GET /api/presence read -
GET /api/releases read -
POST /api/secretary/attachments write signed
GET /api/secretary/attachments/{id} read -
POST /api/secretary/conversations write signed
GET /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/blocks/{sha} read -
GET /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/drawn read -
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/edit act signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/erase tap signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/proposals/{index}/acknowledge tap signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/proposals/{index}/dismiss tap signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/proposals/{index}/drop tap signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/proposals/{index}/tap tap signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/regenerate act signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/say act signed
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/stop act signed
GET /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/stream read -
POST /api/secretary/conversations/{conversation}/title act signed
GET /api/secretary/memory read -
POST /api/secretary/memory/{id}/forget act signed
GET /api/stores/events read -
GET /api/stores/lines/skeleton read -
GET /api/stores/{store}/content read -
GET /api/stores/{store}/objects read -
POST /api/stores/{store}/objects act signed
GET /api/tip read -
GET /api/todo/{id} read -
POST /api/todo/{id}/build tap signed
GET /api/tree read -
GET /api/usage read -
GET /api/waiting read -
POST /api/{chain}/author act signed
GET /api/{chain}/chain read -
GET /api/{chain}/content read -
GET /api/{chain}/events read -
GET /api/{chain}/fold read -
GET /api/{chain}/me read -
GET /api/{chain}/objects read -
POST /api/{chain}/objects act -
GET /api/{chain}/tip read -
GET /api/{chain}/todo/{id} read -
POST /api/{chain}/todo/{id}/build tap signed
GET /api/{chain}/tree read -
GET /events read -
